{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42346","headline":"纳后夕侍宴 · 徐铉","name":"纳后夕侍宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天上轩星正，云间湛露垂。\n礼容过渭水，宴喜胜瑶池。\n彩雾笼花烛，升龙肃羽仪。\n君臣欢乐日，文物盛明时。\n帘卷银河转，香凝玉漏迟。\n华封倾祝意，觞酒与声诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42346.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42346","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}